00:23:40,361 --> 00:23:42,360
And everyone has a favorite.

296
00:23:42,361 --> 00:23:47,360
One of the things I love about the surreal selection we have is that we're out in the middle of the ocean on a warship.

297
00:23:47,361 --> 00:23:50,360
And it's kind of like having a little bit of home with you here.

298
00:23:50,361 --> 00:23:55,360
It's like bringing back childhood memories, you know, sitting back with your family, eating.

