00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:14,120
Moms are busy, want their kids to eat something before they leave the house, so it became a great food for kids.

369
00:29:14,820 --> 00:29:21,320
By the 1950s, a sugar-laden barrage aimed at children propelled the cereal market into hyperdrive.

370
00:29:21,321 --> 00:29:27,320
Cereal evolved from a wholesome product that was designed originally for health,

371
00:29:27,321 --> 00:29:29,320
and then it got off the track.

372
00:29:29,321 --> 00:29:33,320
It became heavily sugared, preserved with chemical preservatives, colored.

373
00:29:33,321 --> 00:29:38,320
We started to learn, especially in the 80s, that we needed to provide better nutrition for kids.

