00:31:33,540 --> 00:31:37,160
The man responsible was Herb Peterson, a McDonald's franchise owner

401
00:31:37,161 --> 00:31:40,120
who helped send the Golden Arches into breakfast history.

402
00:31:40,780 --> 00:31:44,700
One thing that was missing in McDonald's around the world was breakfast.

